{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0502_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0502_1000_p", "source_sha256": "13e932727c81bb9d40b69ea9f8630637cd766721bffeffdcf853dc80d79c379e", "ja": "（雪まつりに参加した昴は、雪合戦コーナーで大活躍。\n大盛りあがりのうちに終了した……）", "zh": "（参加雪祭的昴在打雪仗专区大显身手。\n活动在一片热烈气氛中结束了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0502_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0502_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "faeae35c724d09c144792e7ee6a6fa5a5f0d09429ddf7ebe34025769113c0c66", "ja": "おっす、{$P$}！\n新しい仕事の話って聞いたけど、何？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}！  \n听说是要谈新工作，是什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0502_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0502_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4021ec14ce6e16ea281fb2fba9c5e037a4a14d07f4e684db4fb8cde86e0998c2", "ja": "ああ、始球式のオファーが届いたんだ。といっても\n野球じゃなくて、雪合戦の大会の始球式なんだ。", "zh": "嗯，收到了开球仪式的邀约。虽说是开球仪式，不过不是棒球，而是雪合战大会的开球仪式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0502_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0502_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e9c55c3019e8774be739c19af2aab9a90db476ed7fc1170f9e6def71f5dabd83", "ja": "どうやら主催の人が、この前の雪合戦をみて、\n「永吉さんにお願いしたい！」って言っててね。", "zh": "听说主办方看了上次的打雪仗，说：“想请永吉小姐来！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0502_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0502_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "0755fa3dc2b11a26ec438f0eec7de13e60153904b3fc1657db846c7929b300e7", "ja": "なにそれ！　めっちゃ面白そうじゃん！\nやるやる！　もちろんオッケーだぜ！", "zh": "什么呀！听起来超有意思的！\n要做要做！当然没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0502_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0502_1005_p", "source_sha256": "339e77ca903d9208f828a5e070f46a3d4aa729a743e5394e26c42333fbabc629", "ja": "わかった。それじゃ、先方には返事しておくな。", "zh": "知道了。那我就回复对方了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0502_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0502_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "dabe4e14aa231e367a377d6e4b633dd2bc07b37cf13afd7998e9cd56f7255f56", "ja": "指名されるとか……えへへ、なんか照れるぜ。\nこの前の雪合戦も、すげー楽しかったし……あっ！", "zh": "被指名什么的……嘿嘿，总觉得有点不好意思。\n上次的打雪仗也特别开心……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0502_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0502_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "cce96e7678b08d95cd41f3ee24249712db4be09a738c73a2daf6dfe4c437df06", "ja": "なあ、{$P$}。その大会、\nオレも出場できないかな？　オレ、肩には自信あるぜ！", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。那个比赛，我也能参加吗？我的肩膀可是很有自信的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0502_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0502_1008_p", "source_sha256": "66099a790c5335dbea8007c9ff47ec2e1275342ca759dd5ebeb2ba3d4755da0c", "ja": "大会に……？　あとで確認してみるよ。昴が参加したら\n大会も盛り上がるだろうし、大丈夫だと思うよ。", "zh": "去参赛……？我待会儿去确认一下。昴要是参加的话，\n大赛肯定也会更热闹，我想应该没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0502_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0502_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "d326b378d7803ade782f8606b366f27ac8e134153013d238c10dd4c3669e4eaf", "ja": "やった～！　出るからには、\nやっぱMVPは目指したいよな！　へへ、楽しみだぜ♪", "zh": "太好啦～！既然要参赛，\n那肯定还是得冲着MVP去嘛！嘿嘿，真让人期待啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
